## Trust relationships

| # | Source identity | Target | Method | Credential type | Rotation |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | GitHub Actions (per environment) | Azure | Workload identity federation | None — OIDC | N/A |
| 2 | GitHub Actions | Azure Storage state | OIDC + Azure AD (`use_oidc`, `use_azuread_auth`) | None — OIDC | N/A |
| 3 | Bootstrap operator | Azure | `az login`, interactive with MFA | User token | Per session |
| 4 | Bootstrap operator | GitHub | `gh auth login`, device flow, or App/PAT delivery token | User or installation token | Per session |

There are no static credentials in this deployment. State authenticates to Azure
Storage with Entra ID rather than a shared storage key.

